WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night".

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.370
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.206
[ Audience cheering ]
That's great to hear.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:07.874
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.309
The House of Representatives
voted yesterday

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:12.144
to remove
Speaker Kevin McCarthy.

00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:14.714
Well, Kevin, don't cry
because it's over,

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:16.716
cry because it happened.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:17.817
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.451
That's right,
the House voted yesterday

00:00:19.451 --> 00:00:21.854
to remove a speaker
from power

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.823
for the first time
in 234 years.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.691
Well, they removed him
from office.

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:28.361
It's hard to have power
when you have all the fire

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:31.498
and charisma of
the Facebook silhouette guy.

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:33.499
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:34.801
I mean, look at his face.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.670
This is a man
who either got removed --

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.605
He either got removed
as speaker

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:42.675
or was just called
his brother's name in bed.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.712
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:50.549
[ Mimicking McCarthy ]
"Do I -- Do I say something

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:52.051
or do I just let it go?"

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.054
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.754
The Biden administration
announced today

00:00:55.754 --> 00:00:59.124
that it will forgive $9 billion
in student loans.

00:00:59.124 --> 00:01:01.360
"Well, that should at least
cover most of it",

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.662
said one NYU kid.

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:06.699
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.635
[ Mimicking NYU kid ] "Still
probably need to get a job."

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:11.938
[ Chuckles ]
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:15.374
Manhattan Supreme Court
Judge Arthur Engorgon --

00:01:15.374 --> 00:01:17.176
Uh, no, that's Engoron,
sorry.

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:19.345
Manhattan Supreme Court
Judge Arthur Engoron

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:21.080
placed a limited gag order
yesterday

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.349
on former President Trump
for his civil fraud trial,

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.018
which, if violated,

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:27.186
carries a penalty
of up to 30 days in jail.

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:29.855
Seriously? The guy eats
nothing but fast food

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:31.724
and lives in a Florida
swamp hotel.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:34.294
You're not going to
break him with jail.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.294
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:36.896
He'll come out rested and ready

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:38.798
with three new lawyers.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.903
During his civil fraud
trial yesterday,

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.771
former President Trump's son,
Eric,

00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:47.807
was reportedly seen
biting his nails,

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.510
but Trump put a stop to it.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:53.546
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:59.251
Police in Slovakia recently
shared a traffic camera photo

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:00.786
of what appears
to be a dog

00:02:00.786 --> 00:02:03.522
behind the wheel
of a speeding car.

00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:07.393
He got pulled over, but he
swears the light was gray.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:10.363
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:11.363
It's a good joke.

00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:13.032
It's a good joke...

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:16.836
[ Cheers and applause ]
...about dogs being colorblind.

00:02:19.471 --> 00:02:21.607
Scotland's took the funniest
picture of the day

00:02:21.607 --> 00:02:24.644
and found a very boring thing
to drill down on.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:26.246
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.881
Today was International Walk
to School Day.

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:32.218
This news first reported
by a hungover mom.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:33.753
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.221
[ Mimicking woman ]
"Hey, good news.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.290
It's a holiday."

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.026
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:43.796
"Shhhhh."

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:45.665
Taco Bell announced
yesterday it will offer

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.566
a so-called taco lover pass

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:50.036
that allows customers
to get a taco every day

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.838
for one month for just $10.

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:53.873
So if you love tacos,
maybe you try

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.142
getting them somewhere
other than Taco Bell.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:58.644
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:01.681
That's right, Taco Bell
will offer customers a $10 pass

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:04.917
that allows them to get one taco
every day for one month,

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:06.452
though it's never a good sign

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:08.388
when your promotion
sounds like a punishment

00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:10.556
from a parent in the 1950's.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:14.226
[ Mimicking parent ]
"Oh, you like tacos?

00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:17.697
We'll see how much you like
tacos in a month, wise guy."

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:18.797
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.797 --> 00:03:21.100
[ Mimicking child ]
"What a day."

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.802
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.739
Google announced yesterday
it may no longer deliver e-mails

00:03:27.739 --> 00:03:30.977
from users whose messages
are frequently marked as spam.

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:32.712
In other news,
Crate &amp; Barrel's stock

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:35.014
plunged more than 30% today.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.582
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:38.484
And finally,
Paramount Pictures yesterday

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.419
uploaded the entire movie
"Mean Girls"

00:03:40.419 --> 00:03:42.521
onto the social media platform
TikTok.

00:03:42.521 --> 00:03:45.391
But if you really want
to see "Mean Girls" on TikTok,

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:47.226
just read the comments.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:49.596
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.598
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:53.600
We're up and running.

